# Pairs with NoTurnWaitCycle. This is the #4914 deadlock: the reparent callback is not [AlwaysInterleave].
MODULE: SetParentQueuedBehindCapture
TARGET: NoTurnWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: SetParentAsync queues behind the capture turn that is waiting on it (#4914)
PERTURBS: AdmitSetParent

--- FIND
    /\ seed' = IF SetParentInterleaves \/ leafTurn # "capture" THEN "admitted" ELSE "blocked"
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: SetParentAsync is not [AlwaysInterleave]
    /\ seed' = IF leafTurn # "capture" THEN "admitted" ELSE "blocked"
--- END
